@startuml
title 47 - Evaluación futura de zonas restringidas candidatas para un plan

autonumber
hide footbox

actor "Frontend / Planificador" as Frontend
boundary "API FUTURA PROPUESTA\nGET /planning/restrictions/applicable" as API
control "Evaluador futuro\nNO IMPLEMENTADO" as Evaluator
database "PostgreSQL\n(db_script.sql)" as DB

note over Frontend, DB
FUTURO / NO IMPLEMENTADO.
El repositorio no contiene API ni evaluador.
El flujo describe un contrato objetivo, no comportamiento existente.
Solo devuelve candidatas temporales/vehiculares.
end note

Frontend -> API: GET /planning/restrictions/applicable?\ndispatchPlanId=7301&\nevaluatedAt=2026-09-07T23:30:00-04:00&\nrestrictionType=RESTRICTED_AREA
API -> Evaluator: validar query y zona/offset de evaluatedAt

alt Query no interpretable
  Evaluator --> API: BAD_REQUEST
  API --> Frontend: 400\n{success: false, code: 400, error}
else evaluatedAt sin zona/offset o semántica inválida
  Evaluator --> API: VALIDATION_ERROR
  API --> Frontend: 422\n{success: false, code: 422, error}
else Request válido
  Evaluator -> DB: SELECT * FROM dispatch_plans\nWHERE id = :dispatchPlanId AND deleted_at IS NULL
  DB --> Evaluator: plan o vacío

  alt Plan no encontrado
    Evaluator --> API: DISPATCH_PLAN_NOT_FOUND
    API --> Frontend: 404\n{success: false, code: 404, error}
  else Plan encontrado
    Evaluator -> DB: SELECT planning_trucks + trucks\nWHERE dispatch_plan_id = :dispatchPlanId\nAND filas no eliminadas
    DB --> Evaluator: camiones del plan

    Evaluator -> DB: SELECT * FROM planning_restrictions\nWHERE distributor_id = :plan.distributor_id\nAND restriction_type = 'RESTRICTED_AREA'\nAND is_active = true AND deleted_at IS NULL
    DB --> Evaluator: restricciones activas

    Evaluator -> DB: SELECT * FROM planning_restriction_schedules\nWHERE planning_restriction_id IN (:ids)\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
    DB --> Evaluator: horarios por restricción

    Evaluator -> DB: SELECT * FROM planning_restriction_vehicle_rules\nWHERE planning_restriction_id IN (:ids)\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
    DB --> Evaluator: reglas por restricción

    Evaluator -> Evaluator: evaluar distribuidora, estado y borrado
    Evaluator -> Evaluator: evaluar horarios en evaluatedAt zonificado\n(Y dentro de fila; O entre filas)
    Evaluator -> Evaluator: evaluar reglas contra trucks\n(Y dentro de fila; O entre filas)
    note right of Evaluator
    minCapacityWeightKg:
    capacity_weight_kg >= umbral.

    plateLastDigit:
    primer bloque numérico de trucks.plate,
    último dígito.
    Sin bloque: no coincide y registra
    INVALID_TRUCK_PLATE_FORMAT.

    plate, en ambos lados:
    quitar espacios exteriores + mayúsculas;
    conserva separadores internos.
    end note

    alt No hay candidatas temporales/vehiculares
      Evaluator --> API: candidates = []
      API --> Frontend: 200\n{success: true, code: 200, data}
    else Hay candidatas temporales/vehiculares
      Evaluator -> Evaluator: asignar spatialEvaluation.status\n= NOT_EVALUATED a cada candidata
      Evaluator --> API: candidatas con estado espacial pendiente
      API --> Frontend: 200\n{success: true, code: 200, data}
    end
  end
end

note over Evaluator, DB
Consulta sin escritura.
No actualiza planning_trucks.is_included_in_routing,
planning_trucks.exclusion_reason ni
planning_trucks.excluded_by_restriction_id.
La existencia de esa FK no prueba lógica backend.
La evaluación espacial requiere otro contrato futuro;
este endpoint no la invoca ni recibe resultados de ella.
end note

@enduml
